Z||000012||Cheever3000||10-15-2001||10:27 PM||||My best friend had a Gremlin-X.  I was in the passenger seat when he beat a 67 Malibu SS by several car lengths, no kidding.  I understood they made a 407 for the AMX, cause my friend wanted to put one in his Gremlin.  We heard that some people had done that with great results.  I never sat in an AMX, but always liked them.  I personally never wanted a Gremlin, but have to admit it was a fun car.<P>||||reg||1
